	JMP   BTP
INIF1,	TAC
	AZE I
	JMP   GETX
	COM
	STC   10
	JMP   INIF
GETX,	RDC I
	2020	/FIRST BLOCK OF INDEX
	JMP   TPD
	NOP	/SECOND BLOCK ISN T READ ANYMORE 
